Banking77 sample for Minos.NET.Evaluation

Messages and intent names (source/test-subset.csv and the "state" text of the JSONL files)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Banking77 messages and their intent names are by PolyAI Limited and are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Source: https://github.com/PolyAI-LDN/task-specific-datasets, file banking_data/test.csv, commit
57ec275d8078af65b7731c2a98be812d844a6d6b.
Reference: Casanueva et al., "Efficient Intent Detection with Dual Sentence Encoders", 2020.

Changes made: only the rows of 10 intents were kept, and they were converted to the Minos.NET dataset format with
questions added. The messages themselves are unchanged. The licensor does not endorse this use.

